  <style>
    :root{--brand:#5F8A8B;--brand-dark:#3D5C5D;--gold:#C9A962;--cream:#F5EED6;--cream-dark:#EBE4CC;--stone:#3A3A3A;--stone-light:#5c5c5c}
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}body{font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;background:var(--cream);color:var(--stone);line-height:1.8}
    a{color:var(--brand)} .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:96px 24px 60px}
    .breadcrumb{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:24px;color:var(--stone-light)} .breadcrumb a{text-decoration:none}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand) 0%,var(--brand-dark) 100%);border-radius:28px;padding:44px 36px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:32px}
    .badge{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:18px}
    h1,h2{font-family:"Playfair Display",serif;line-height:1.15}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,52px);margin-bottom:16px}.hero p{max-width:700px;opacity:.94}
    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:34px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.06);margin-bottom:24px}
    h2{font-size:30px;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:16px}.card p,.card li{margin-bottom:16px}.card ul{padding-left:22px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:18px}.pill{background:var(--cream-dark);border-radius:18px;padding:22px}
    .cta{background:var(--brand-dark);color:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:32px;text-align:center;margin-top:32px}
    .cta a{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold) 0%,#b8943a 100%);color:#2f2f2f;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span> <span aria-current="page">Concierge Services</span>
    </nav>
    <section class="hero">
      <span class="badge">Guest Services</span>
      <h1>Concierge Services for Seascape Vacations Guests</h1>
      <p>Your stay should run smoothly before you arrive, not just after you check in. We help guests coordinate the local details that usually create friction: groceries, reservations, charters, spa appointments, and activity planning.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="card">
      <h2>What we can help arrange</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="pill"><strong>Arrival setup</strong><p>Grocery pre-stocking, timing coordination, and practical pre-arrival requests.</p></div>
        <div class="pill"><strong>Dining</strong><p>Restaurant recommendations and reservation help for family dinners, date nights, and group outings.</p></div>
        <div class="pill"><strong>Water activities</strong><p>Charters, fishing trips, boat days, and other Gulf Coast experiences.</p></div>
        <div class="pill"><strong>Relaxation</strong><p>Spa bookings, wellness appointments, and easy local recommendations.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="card">
      <h2>How concierge service works</h2>
      <p>Reach out when you want help lining up the details before arrival or during your stay. We will tell you what we can handle directly, what outside vendors manage themselves, and what needs more lead time.</p>
      <p>Some concierge help is simple recommendation support. Some requests involve third-party vendors and availability constraints. The earlier you reach out, the more useful this service becomes.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Recommendation and coordination support is part of the guest experience.</li>
        <li>Third-party providers bill directly for their own services.</li>
        <li>We can guide you faster when you tell us your group size, dates, and priorities up front.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="cta">
      <h2>Need help planning the details?</h2>
      <p>Book your stay first or reach out before arrival if you want help coordinating the experience around it.</p>
      <a href="/properties/">Browse Our Homes</a>
    </section>
  </main>
  {% include "partials/analytics-ga4.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
